 is the Baker domain of period 
\begin_inset Formula $2$
\end_inset

 such that 
\begin_inset Formula $0\in\partial F_{0}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $f_{\lambda,\mu}(F_{0})=F_{\infty}$
\end_inset

.
