\begin_inset Formula $c_{1},c_{-1}\in F_{0}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $c_{k},c_{-k}\in F_{\infty}$
\end_inset

 for all 
\begin_inset Formula $k>1$
\end_inset

.
